			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-718666">
									

<p>Hm. I'm not really feeling this one, somehow. I like the idea of SCPs that have to be described using orbital mechanics, and I like the implications behind an object that ignores <em>our</em> gravity and goes sailing along in merry, potentially-destructive obedience to something <em>else</em>'s. Still, the end-of-the-world oh-shit provisions seem somehow overly dramatic. Frankly, the Foundation deals in worse threats than these every day: it's got standard warning signals and terminology for 'em. (XK-class, anyone? The best thing about that phrase is that it implies other letter-designations.)</p>

