<p>what is causing 225-2 to follow the path that it's on? seeing as it isnt orbiting the sun because of gravity it's almost as if someone programmed its orbital path in the distant past with the intent of it following earth's exact course, but due to unpredictable variations in earth's orbit over the millenia the two no longer match quite so precisely.</p>
